  "reason": "Only one experiment is completed, so evidence is sparse: RNA-only single-profile PCA gives moderate accuracy and F1, but it does not tell whether the image modality contains useful signal. config_010 is a minimal image-only baseline with single profile, ResNet50, and no aggregation or fusion, so it cleanly tests image representation and provides a second unimodal reference. This is the best next experiment under a limited budget because it avoids assuming that multimodal or multiprofile models will help, and it will clarify whether later effort should focus on image, RNA, or fusion."
